OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for daylight zombie
OL,4,Aknife stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed his victim with a
OL,7,Fzombie knife in Derbyshire has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FLuke Hurdowar pulled up in a car
OL,11,Falongside the other man in Cotmanhay
OL,12,FRoad, Cotmanhay, near Ilkeston, just
OL,13,Fafter 12:00 BST on 26 June last year.
OL,15,FThe pair, who were known to each other,
OL,16,Fbegan arguing and after the victim
OL,17,Fthrew punches at him, 24-year-old
OL,18,FHurdowar pulled a 30cm knife from the
OL,19,Fwaistband of his trousers and stabbed
OL,20,Fhim twice before driving away.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
